# Historical firmware README

The current, repository-specific Feather M4 CAN Express firmware documentation is **[README.md](README.md)**.

The old contents of this file described an earlier FalangeM4 / FalangeGUI layout and included paths that are **not** valid in this repository (for example, `FalangeM4/` and `tests/firmware/`). Those instructions have been superseded by the current [Feather firmware guide](README.md), [top-level README](../README.md), [protocol design](../docs/tactile_rate_mcu_v2.md), and [architecture notes](ARCHITECTURE.md).

This file is retained as a compatibility pointer for links to the historical `README` filename.
